style="color: #24292E;">{">"}</span></div><div class="line"><span style="color: #24292E;">{"    document."}</span><span style="color: #6F42C1;">{"addEventListener"}</span><span style="color: #24292E;">{"("}</span><span style="color: #032F62;">{"'alpine:init'"}</span><span style="color: #24292E;">{", () "}</span><span style="color: #D73A49;">{"=>"}</span><span style="color: #24292E;">{" {"}</span></div><div class="line"><span style="color: #24292E;">{"        Alpine."}</span><span style="color: #6F42C1;">{"store"}</span><span style="color: #24292E;">{"("}</span><span style="color: #032F62;">{"'darkMode'"}</span><span style="color: #24292E;">{", {"}</span></div><div class="line"><span style="color: #24292E;">{"            on: "}</span><span style="color: #005CC5;">{"false"}</span><span style="color: #24292E;">{","}</span></div><div class="line">{" "}</div><div class="line"><span style="color: #24292E;">{"            "}</span><span style="color: #6F42C1;">{"toggle"}</span><span style="color: #24292E;">{"() {"}</span></div><div class="line"><span style="color: #24292E;">{"                "}</span><span style="color: #005CC5;">{"this"}</span><span style="color: #24292E;">{".on "}</span><span style="color: #D73A49;">{"="}</span><span style="color: #24292E;">{" "}</span><span style="color: #D73A49;">{"!"}</span><span style="color: #24292E;">{" "}</span><span style="color: #005CC5;">{"this"}</span><span style="color: #24292E;">{".on"}</span></div><div class="line"><span style="color: #24292E;">{"            }"}</span></div><div class="line"><span style="color: #24292E;">{"        })"}</span></div><div class="line"><span style="color: #24292E;">{"    })"}</span></div><div class="line"><span style="color: #24292E;">{"</"}</span><span style="color: #22863A;">{"script"}</span><span style="color: #24292E;">{">"}</span></div><div aria-hidden="true" hidden tabindex="-1" style="display: none;" class="torchlight-copy-target">{"\n<button x-data @click=\"$store.darkMode.toggle()\">Toggle Dark Mode</button>\n\n...\n\n<div x-data :class=\"$store.darkMode.on && 'bg-black'\">\n    ...\n</div>\n\n\n<script>\n    document.addEventListener('alpine:init', () => {\n        Alpine.store('darkMode', {\n            on: false,\n\n            toggle() {\n                this.on = ! this.on\n            }\n        })\n    })\n</script>"}</div></code></pre>
				<p>
					Given that we've registered the{" "}<code>darkMode</code>{" "}store and set{" "}<code>on</code>{" "}to "false", when the{" "}<code>&lt;button&gt;</code>{" "}is pressed,{" "}<code>on</code>{" "}will be "true" and the background color of the page will change to black.
				</p>
				<h2 id="single-value-stores"><a href="#single-value-stores">Single-value stores</a></h2>
				<p>If you don't need an entire object for a store, you can set and use any kind of data as a store.</p>
